# Interactive Television: The State of the Industry.

**Authors:** Galbreath, Jeremy

## Abstract
Discusses interactive television in the context of the developing information superhighway. Topics include potential applications, including video on demand; telecommunications companies; digital media technologies; content; regulatory issues; the nature of technology users; origination components; distribution/infrastructure components; destination components; and standards. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ520236

